WEBVTT

1
00:05:58.099 --> 00:06:02.355
Good morning and welcome to the Board of
County Commissioners meeting.

2
00:06:02.355 --> 00:06:04.300
Today is Tuesday, September 8th.

3
00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:08.799
We do begin each of our meetings with an
invocation, and this morning, um,

4
00:06:08.799 --> 00:06:12.872
we have someone from Citywide Prayer and
Decision Point Ministries,

5
00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:16.276
and I would invite you to come and
introduce yourselves,

6
00:06:16.276 --> 00:06:19.377
and I'll invite everyone here to stand and
join us.

7
00:06:19.377 --> 00:06:20.340
Good morning.

8
00:06:20.388 --> 00:06:22.905
I have a wonderful Korean name, Daisap
Han.

9
00:06:24.301 --> 00:06:24.942
So let's pray.

10
00:06:25.584 --> 00:06:30.065
So Father, what a blessing it is to be
here at El Paso, um,

11
00:06:30.065 --> 00:06:32.268
County Commissioners meeting.

12
00:06:32.268 --> 00:06:35.230
Father, thank you, Lord, for these, uh,

13
00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:41.002
wonderful servant leaders that you have
chosen to serve not only our county,

14
00:06:41.002 --> 00:06:46.547
but their decisions will impact our state
in this 150th anniversary year,

15
00:06:46.547 --> 00:06:52.395
as well as our nation and even beyond.
Lord, I ask that you would bless them.

16
00:06:52.395 --> 00:06:57.180
You would also, um, Bless our county, uh,
county clerk, Father,

17
00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.294
and their families and their staff, Lord.

18
00:07:00.294 --> 00:07:06.294
And I pray that you would provide them
with wisdom and guidance, uh, this hour,

19
00:07:06.294 --> 00:07:12.143
this morning, as they will make some
important decisions on behalf of El Paso

20
00:07:12.143 --> 00:07:18.067
County. Thank you, Lord, for being with us
this morning. In Jesus' name, amen.

21
00:07:18.067 --> 00:07:23.119
Commissioner

22
00:07:23.119 --> 00:07:26.908
Williams,

23
00:07:26.908 --> 00:07:33.645
if you'd lead us

24
00:07:33.645 --> 00:07:39.539
in the pledge.

25
00:07:39.539 --> 00:07:42.486
Item 3.

26
00:07:42.486 --> 00:07:45.320
Item number 3 is staff emergency items,

27
00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.025
and I'm unaware of any staff emergency
items today.

28
00:07:49.849 --> 00:07:50.301
Item 4.

29
00:07:50.301 --> 00:07:54.184
Item number 4 is changes, postponements,
and notice of the next meeting.

30
00:07:54.184 --> 00:07:57.528
I'm unaware of any changes or
postponements to today's agenda,

31
00:07:57.528 --> 00:07:59.577
and the next meeting will be Thursday,

32
00:07:59.577 --> 00:08:03.568
September 10th at 9 o'clock for land use
and then the Board of Adjustment.

33
00:08:03.568 --> 00:08:05.908
Item 5.

34
00:08:05.908 --> 00:08:11.902
Item number 5 is the consent calendar
including items 5A through 5N4.

35
00:08:11.902 --> 00:08:18.150
Okay, is there anyone here who wishes to
speak on an item on the consent calendar

36
00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.078
today? Okay, seeing none,

37
00:08:20.078 --> 00:08:25.477
I'll bring it up here for any comments or
a motion from commissioners.

38
00:08:25.477 --> 00:08:27.811
I move approval of the consent calendar.

39
00:08:27.811 --> 00:08:29.888
Second.

40
00:08:29.888 --> 00:08:33.823
Okay, it's been moved and seconded. One
more opportunity for any comments.

